 199 meets Federal Highway 307)."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the city of Acapulco."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the city of Tijuana, except: airside transit through Tijuana airport the Cross Border Xpress bridge from the airport linking terminals across the Mexican-US border the federal toll road 1D and Via Rápida through Tijuana to the border FCDO advises against all but essential travel to the city of Tecate in Baja California, including roads between Tijuana and Tecate."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the state of Chihuahua, except: the city of Chihuahua the border crossing in Ciudad Juárez (accessed by federal toll road 45) federal toll road 45D connecting the cities of Chihuahua and Ciudad Juárez the Copper Canyon rail route to and from Chihuahua and towns immediately on this route including Creel the road from Creel via San Juanito to San Pedro state highway 16 from San Pedro to Chihuahua There are high levels of organised crime activity, particularly human and drugs trafficking."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the state of Sinaloa, except: the cities of Los Mochis and Mazatlán road 32 that runs between El Fuerte and Los Mochis the 15D federal toll road that runs the length of the state the Copper Canyon rail route to and from Los Mochis, El Fuerte and the towns immediately on this route Armed robbery and vehicle theft has happened in El Fuerte."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the state of Tamaulipas, except: the border crossing at Nuevo Laredo accessed from Monterrey by federal toll road 85D – you should travel during daylight hours federal highways 80, 81 and 85 between Tampico, Ciudad de Victoria and Magueyes, and the entire area of Tamaulipas south of these highways Tamaulipas is dangerous due to the presence of many organised crime groups who fight for control of drug trafficking routes."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the state of Zacatecas."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the areas south-west of the road 45D."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the state of Michoacán, except the: city of Morelia accessed by federal toll roads 15D, 126 and 43; and the federal toll road 48D between the city of Morelia and the General Francisco Mujica airport town of Pátzcuaro accessed by federal toll roads 14D and 15 from Morelia, and boat trips out to islands on Lake Pátzcuaro federal highway 15D Michoacán is one of Mexico’s most violent states with high levels of organised crime and very little security presence."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the areas south and south-west of Lake Chapala to the border state of Colima, specifically the municipalities of: Acatlán de Juárez Amacueca Ameca Atemajac de Brizuela Atengo Atenguillo Atoyac Autlán de Navarro Ayutla Casimiro Castillo Chiquilistlán Cocula Cuautitlán de García Barragán Cuautla Ejutla El Grullo El Limón Gómez Farias Guachinango Juchitlán Mixtlán San Gabriel San Marcos San Martín Hidalgo Sayula Tapalpa Techaluta de Montenegro Tecolotlán Tenamaxtlán Teocuitatlán de Corona Tolimán Tonaya Tuxcacuesco Tuxcueca Unión de Tula Villa Corona Villa Purificación Zacoalco de Torres Zapotitlán de Vadill Zapotlán el Grande FCDO advises against all but essential travel to the northern municipalities of: Bolaños Chimaltitán Colotlán Hostotipaquillo Huejúcar Huequilla el Alto Mezquitic San Martin de Bolaños Santa Maria de los Ángeles Totatiche Villa Guerrero This is due to inaccessibility for security forces, lack of state control, drugs cultivation and high levels of violence between rival criminal groups."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the whole state of Colima, except the city of Manzanillo accessed by sea or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport, and direct travel via road 200 from the airport to Manzanillo."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Nov-Apr (dry season, calm, humpbacks Dec-Mar, Careyes polo/events season, ultra-villa demand highest)","shoulder":"May & late Oct (warm, quieter, pre/post rains)","green":"Jul-Oct (hot/humid, emerald hills, hurricane window May-Nov, softer rates)","event_peak":"Careyes polo late-Nov->end-Apr (Agua Alta Cup at Easter); Ondalinda x Careyes Nov 12-15 2026","booking_window_lead_time":"ultra villas for Christmas-New Year/winter holidays book 6-12 months ahead, contracted direct on application; green-season windows far shorter","out_of_season_fill_the_beds":"green season (Jul-Oct) eco/wildlife (turtle nesting, biosphere), sportfishing, storm-quiet villa buyouts at softer rates - the ''secret season''","holiday_event_peaks":"Christmas-New Year (ultra premium), Semana Santa/Easter (Agua Alta Cup polo), Ondalinda (mid-Nov), winter polo season","campaign_start_trigger":"content-only - no campaign; if founder rules carve-out for private-airstrip enclaves, open winter/holiday villa campaigns in spring for following Nov-Apr peak (6-12-mo lead)","sources":["https://mexiconewsdaily.com/travel/an-insiders-guide-to-the-perfect-weekend-in-costalegre/","https://www.ondalinda.com/festivals/careyes/","https://www.costalegre.ca/"]},"jewels":[{"name":"Careyes clifftop Castles & Iconic Villas","si_tag":"Luxury / Ultra-Luxury","status":"future","tier":"ultra","bookable":"Careyes reservations / villa specialist","source":"https://careyes.com/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"staffed clifftop villas with moat-like infinity pools; Heidi Klum married here, celebrities vacation here","si":"ultra","blurb":"staffed clifftop villas with moat-like infinity pools; Heidi Klum married here, celebrities vacation here","when":"year-round","commission":"on application / villa specialist"},{"name":"Cuixmala (Casa Cuixmala suites / hillside villas)","si_tag":"Luxury / Ultra-Luxury","status":"future","tier":"ultra","bookable":"Cuixmala direct / luxury DMC","source":"https://cuixmala.com/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Goldsmith''s 25,000-acre reserve estate — zebras, nesting turtles, total seclusion","si":"ultra","blurb":"Goldsmith''s 25,000-acre reserve estate — zebras, nesting turtles, total seclusion","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"on application"},{"name":"Las Alamandas","si_tag":"Luxury / Ultra-Luxury","status":"future","tier":"ultra","bookable":"Las Alamandas direct / DMC","source":"https://www.alamandas.com/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"18 suites across 8 villas, gated ultra-boutique. On application","si":"ultra","blurb":"18 suites across 8 villas, gated ultra-boutique. On application","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"on application"},{"name":"Chamela Bay islands (Isla Cocinas / Isla Pajarera)","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"future","tier":"essential","bookable":"local panga boat tour (content-only)","source":"https://mexiconewsdaily.com/travel/an-insiders-guide-to-the-perfect-weekend-in-costalegre/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"tropical","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"local operator (n/a while content-only)"},{"name":"Tenacatita Bay","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"future","tier":"comfort","bookable":"local operators (content-only)","source":"https://mexiconewsdaily.com/travel/an-insiders-guide-to-the-perfect-weekend-in-costalegre/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"is famed for clear water, snorkeling, kayaking and paddleboarding; Chamela Bay is dotted with marine-reserve islands reachable by boat tour","si":"tropical","blurb":"is famed for clear water, snorkeling, kayaking and paddleboarding; Chamela Bay is dotted with marine-reserve islands reachable by boat tour","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"local (content-only)"},{"name":"Barra de Navidad lagoon village","si_tag":"Romance & Honeymoons","status":"future","tier":"premier","bookable":"Grand Isla Navidad Resort / boutique (content-only)","source":"https://www.mexicotravelandleisure.com/blog/barra-de-navidad-mexico/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"colonial-shipyard fishing town with a scenic lagoon and slow small-town charm — an authentic couples'' base","si":"romance","blurb":"colonial-shipyard fishing town with a scenic lagoon and slow small-town charm — an authentic couples'' base","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"OTA/DMC (content-only for the coast)"},{"name":"Winter humpback whale coast (Dec-Mar)","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"essential","bookable":"local whale/boat tour (content-only)","source":"https://www.costalegre.ca/","si":"ocean","commission":"local operator (content-only)"}],"faq":[{"q":"Can I book Costalegre through TravelWell right now?","a":"No — it is content-only. Jalisco sits at US State Dept Level 3 \"Reconsider Travel\" (May 29, 2026), and the advisory''s four named no-restriction carve-outs (Guadalajara Metro, Puerto Vallarta, Chapala, Ajijic) do not include the southern-Jalisco Costalegre coast, so book_enabled=FALSE.","source":"travel.state.gov, 2026-05-29","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for on Costalegre?","a":"The road transfer, and the remoteness. Ground access runs through non-carve-out southern Jalisco on Highway 200 and secondary roads, and the advisory warns against secondary highways after dark — the hold reason. The coast is remote: serious cases route ~1.5 hr to Manzanillo or 2–4 hr to Puerto Vallarta, so air-evac insurance is essential.","source":"travel.state.gov / lprluxury.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What makes Costalegre a true ultra coast?","a":"Three private enclaves with their own airstrips. Careyes (clifftop castles + ~50 staffed villas), Cuixmala (a ~25,000-acre Goldsmith biosphere estate) and Las Alamandas (an 18-suite gated boutique) form one of Mexico''s most private ultra nodes — the private-air arrival is the crux of a possible future clean-pass.","source":"cuixmala.com / careyes.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"What are the best beaches and islands here?","a":"Chamela Bay and Tenacatita. Chamela is dotted with marine-reserve islets (Isla Cocinas, Isla Pajarera) reachable by panga, and Tenacatita (~30 min north of Barra de Navidad) is famed for clear, calm water for snorkel, kayak and SUP — the calmest bays on a ~200-mile coast.","source":"mexiconewsdaily.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"When can I see whales on Costalegre?","a":"December to March. Humpbacks migrate and breach offshore along the whole coast in the dry winter season — the same window as peak ultra-villa demand — while the Chamela–Cuixmala biosphere adds turtle nesting and dry-forest wildlife. Keep a regulated distance on any boat tour.","source":"costalegre.ca, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Costalegre Mexico: Careyes, Cuixmala & the Wild Jalisco Coast","meta_description":"Costalegre — ~200 mi of undeveloped Jalisco Pacific coast between Puerto Vallarta and Manzanillo: Careyes, Cuixmala, Las Alamandas, Tenacatita, Barra de Navidad. Ultra villas, whales, biosphere.","slug":"costalegre-mexico","primary_keyword":"Costalegre Mexico","long_tail":["Costalegre luxury villas","Careyes Cuixmala Las Alamandas","Costalegre vs Puerto Vallarta","Tenacatita Bay snorkeling","Barra de Navidad travel guide","Costalegre whale watching Dec-Mar"],"search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["Costalegre Jalisco","villas de lujo Careyes","Cuixmala reserva biosfera","Las Alamandas Costalegre","Bahia Tenacatita snorkel","Barra de Navidad que hacer","avistamiento de ballenas Costalegre"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"tropical","status":"future"},{"si":"romance","status":"future"},{"si":"Luxury / Ultra-Luxury","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Cuixmala","posture":"Goldsmith ~25,000-acre biosphere estate; suites/villas/casitas; private airstrip","price_tier":"ultra","earning":"on application / luxury DMC (Journey Mexico) / villa specialist","virtuoso_value_add":"likely via luxury-DMC channel - verify at contract","mor":"no net-rate resale","book_gated":"founder carve-out decision (private-airstrip clean-pass class)","source":"https://cuixmala.com/"},{"name":"Careyes (Casitas / Villas / Castles)","posture":"Brignone 1968 enclave; hotel + casitas + ~50 villas + clifftop castles; polo/sailing/Ondalinda; private-air (Chamela strip ~15 min / Chalacatepec ~40 min)","price_tier":"ultra","earning":"on application / villa specialist","virtuoso_value_add":"verify at contract","mor":"no net-rate resale","book_gated":"founder carve-out decision","source":"https://careyes.com/"},{"name":"Las Alamandas","posture":"Isabel Goldsmith 18-suite gated ultra-boutique on private bay; own 3,300-ft airstrip (currently unavailable - use Chamela strip 15 min)","price_tier":"ultra","earning":"on application / DMC","virtuoso_value_add":"likely via luxury-DMC channel - verify","mor":"no net-rate resale","book_gated":"founder carve-out decision","source":"https://www.alamandas.com/"},{"name":"El Careyes (Club & Residences)","posture":"beachfront club/residences arm of Careyes enclave","price_tier":"luxury","earning":"on application","virtuoso_value_add":"verify at contract","mor":"no net-rate resale","book_gated":"founder carve-out decision","source":"https://careyes.com/"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"Costalegre (Costa Alegre), Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":19.44,"lng":-105.04}}'::jsonb, 50)
